# Skirmishers attacks in no band beside Memnite, and is killed in response to its attack trigger: as it last existed it was
# banded with nothing, so Memnite - another attacker in no band - does not gain first strike (CR 608.2h, 702.22c).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Icatian Skirmishers
Memnite
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Icatian Skirmishers.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Icatian Skirmishers > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2)
Bot1.Choose()
? Combat.Attackers = Icatian Skirmishers > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Icatian Skirmishers)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Icatian Skirmishers; Black Lotus
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
